WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Manhattan: choose your next district.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Midtown: check the votes and available tactics.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Campaign to add support in the district.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Smear to reduce a rival’s votes.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.000
End the turn. Your rivals make their moves.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.300
